/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Translation layer for HerCare+.

   Coverage strategy: every UI string has an English source of truth in `en`
   (the type of record `StringKey`). Hindi (`hi`) and Kannada (`kn`) carry a
   COMPLETE translation of every key, so selecting a language localizes the
   whole interface with no English leftovers (brand/technical/medical terms and
   numbers stay in their standard form). Any missing key falls back to English
   so nothing ever renders blank. Long-form health *article* bodies are
   localized per-language in data/articles.ts.
   ------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

